# Mondlandung mit akustischen Effekten (Moon Landing with sound effects)
# Manual Part 1, p. 24, with the changes and the addition from address 90 of manual Part 2, p. 56.
# Needs the tone circuit (multivibrator) on outputs 1-4. Each ending has its own tone sequence:
# soft landing, crash, fuel used up, lunar module drifts off.
# Address AB: the manual prints the mnemonic ADC D next to the code FBC (ADC C); the code is used -
# it counts the repeats of the landing tune in register C, which ADC D would never end.

